# Getting started

Pages in this folder are compiled to `/generated/markdown-content.json` at build time, then served at `/markdown-content` by `MarkdownView`.

## Adding a page

Create a `.md` file anywhere in `markdown-content/`. Its YAML frontmatter is optional:

```yaml
---
title: My page        # defaults to the first "# Heading"
description: Summary  # defaults to the first paragraph
slug: my-page         # defaults to the file name
order: 2              # pages are sorted by order, then by path
group: Guides         # groups pages under a heading in the navigation
---
```

## Linking pages

Link to another page with its relative path, like [writing pages](./writing-pages.md) —
the link becomes an in-app route. A link to a missing page fails the build.
